   m_sTitle "BLUFOR Objectives"
   m_sTextData "Destroy the marked Rush objectives. Be advised that ION forces are in the area, interested in the intelligence folder your commander is carrying. "\
   ""\
   "Mission Maker Notes"\
   "- Shareable markers are enabled, and GI radios are off"\
   "- Mortars are allowed a resupply at phase change"\
   "- Mortars are limited to minimum charges"\
   "- Use your equipment advantages wisely, MOUT will be bloody"
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  COA_MissionDescriptor "{64425051B9B5AF67}" {
   m_sTitle "OPFOR Objectives"
   m_sTextData "Defend the marked Rush objectives. Be advised that ION forces are in the area, and are interested in the intelligence folder your commander is carrying. "\
   ""\
   "Mission Maker Notes"\
   "- Shareable markers are enabled, and BFT is off for your faction."\
   "- Your forces will largely perform better in CQC, be wary of long sightlines"
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  COA_MissionDescriptor "{644250519BE30999}" {
   m_sTitle "INDFOR Objectives"
   m_sTextData "Your goal is to get an intelligence folder from both BLUE and RED platoon leadership. "\
   ""\
   "Mission Maker Notes"\
